            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ராணி அழகான தோட்டத்தில் நடந்தாள். rāṇi aḻakāṉa tōṭṭattil naṭantāḷ. The queen walked in a beautiful garden."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also the queen in chess and in cards."
            }
          ]
        },
